request.description:
WebSocket STOMP endpoint.

Connect WebSocket to ws://<host>/ws (or the configured STOMP endpoint).

Client SEND: /app/group/{groupId}/message
Server BROADCAST: /topic/group/{groupId}

Payload example:
{
  "groupId": "{{groupId}}",
  "message": "Hey everyone!",
  "messageType": "TEXT"
}
